commit 42c222979ddafc3a8ba2456b28dffcab9b9727d8
Author: Adam010341 <adam010341@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 10 10:11:51 2026 +0800

    tests: run the shape and priority rules as user writes now that NDTwin owns its tables
    
    With the owner check merged, every table of NDTwin's own pipeline answers 409 before the
    entry is built, so the shape, priority and read-back tests bind a user pipeline the way the
    other writer tests already do. The two section 1.5 tests that pinned the empty-match
    catch-all as accepted now expect the refusal, each with a user-pipeline control, and a new
    test pins that the owner check answers before the shape rules. Comments that still waited on
    the owner check are updated, and the owner gate names the renamed real-p4info test.

